{#-
  Base email layout shared by every event-type template (T4.1).

  Mirrors the app's console UI: the same light palette (paper #fafaf8, white
  card, ink #1b1b1f, one accent — the calendar pen red #c93b2b), the same 10px
  panel radius, the same hairline-separated bands (head / body / footer), and
  the two signature marks — the calendar leaf and the countdown pill — drawn
  exactly as the event rows draw them.

  Deliberately light even though the app renders dark on a dark OS: mail clients
  handle dark backgrounds inconsistently and many force their own, so the light
  palette is the one that survives everywhere.

  Email-safe HTML: tables for the head band (Outlook ignores flex), inline-
  friendly markup, and a ``<style>`` block that premailer (T4.2) inlines onto
  the elements at render time. Child templates override the blocks below;
  ``manage_url`` is rendered in the footer of EVERY email so an unsubscribe /
  preferences link is always present.

  Context placeholders (see T4.1): recipient_name, title, days_before,
  days_phrase, countdown_label, occurrence_date, leaf_month, leaf_day, message,
  manage_url.
-#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <title>{% block preview_title %}{{ title }}{% endblock %}</title>
    <style type="text/css">
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #fafaf8;
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        color: #1b1b1f;
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      }
      .wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #fafaf8;
        padding: 24px 0 36px 0;
      }
      .frame {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 16px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      .brand-row {
        padding: 8px 4px 16px 4px;
      }
      .brand {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        color: #1b1b1f;
      }
      .brand-dot {
        color: #c93b2b;
      }
      /* Panel: 10px radius and hairline bands, matching .form-panel in the app. */
      .container {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 10px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid #e8e7e2;
      }
      .head {
        padding: 18px 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e7e2;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 20px;
      }
      /* Calendar leaf — the app's signature mark (58x62, 10px radius). */
      .leaf {
        width: 58px;
        height: 62px;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #e8e7e2;
        border-radius: 10px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .leaf-month {
        display: block;
        font-family: Menlo, Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1.2px;
        color: #c93b2b;
      }
      .leaf-day {
        display: block;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.4px;
        line-height: 1.1;
        color: #1b1b1f;
      }
      .headline {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 20px;
        line-height: 1.25;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        color: #1b1b1f;
      }
      .date-line {
        margin: 4px 0 0 0;
        font-family: Menlo, Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #6d6d75;
      }
      /* Countdown pill — .row-count-soon from the event list. */
      .pill {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: Menlo, Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #c93b2b;
        background-color: #faeae6;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 4px 11px;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .paragraph {
        margin: 0 0 14px 0;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #6d6d75;
      }
      .occasion {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #c93b2b;
      }
      .note {
        margin: 16px 0 0 0;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        background-color: #fafaf8;
        border-left: 3px solid #c93b2b;
        border-radius: 0 7px 7px 0;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-style: italic;
        color: #1b1b1f;
      }
      .note-label {
        display: block;
        margin: 0 0 6px 0;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-style: normal;
        color: #c93b2b;
      }
      .footer {
        padding: 18px 4px 8px 4px;
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #9b9ba3;
      }
      .footer a {
        color: #6d6d75;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="frame">
        <div class="brand-row">
          <p class="brand">wishly<span class="brand-dot">.</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="container">
          {# Head band: leaf + title + date on the left, countdown on the right —
             the same reading order as a row in the app's occasions list. #}
          <div class="head">
            <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
              <tr>
                <td width="58" valign="top">
                  <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="leaf">
                    <tr>
                      <td align="center" valign="middle">
                        <span class="leaf-month">{{ leaf_month }}</span>
                        <span class="leaf-day">{{ leaf_day }}</span>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                </td>
                <td valign="top" style="padding-left: 14px;">
                  <h1 class="headline">{% block headline %}{{ title }}{% endblock %}</h1>
                  <p class="date-line">{{ occurrence_date }}</p>
                </td>
                <td valign="top" align="right">
                  <span class="pill">{{ countdown_label }}</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </div>

          <div class="content">
            {% block body %}{% endblock %}
            {% if message %}
            <div class="note">
              <span class="note-label">Your note</span>
              &ldquo;{{ message }}&rdquo;
            </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
          {% block footer_extra %}{% endblock %}
          <p>
            You&rsquo;re getting this because you track this date on Wishly.
            <br />
            <a href="{{ manage_url }}">Manage your reminders or unsubscribe</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
